<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title>IRC channel logs</title><style>html {
  background: #fdfdfd;
}

h1 {
  font-weight: 300;
}

h2 {
  font-weight: 200;
}

h3 {
  padding: .5em 0;
  border-top: 3px dotted #ddd;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

form {
  width: 400px;
  display: flex;
}

input {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  border-radius: .25em 0 0 .25em;
  border: 1px solid #aaa;
  border-right: 0;
  padding: 0.5em;
}

button {
  display: flex;
  border-radius: 0 .25em .25em 0;
  background-color: #007bff;
  border: 1px solid #007bff;
  padding: .5em;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: white;
}

button:hover {
  background-color: #0069d9;
  border-color: #0062cc;
}

a {
  color: #007bff;
  text-decoration: none;
}

a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

h4 {
  margin-bottom: .5em;
}

table td {
  padding: 0.75em;
}

table tr:hover {
  background: #eee;
}

.year {
  display: table;
}

.month {
  display: table-cell;
  padding-right: 1em;
}

ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.nick {
  padding-right: 0.6rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: right;
  width: 13rem;
  display: table-cell;
}

.nick a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.message {
  display: table-cell;
  padding-left: 0.6rem;
  border-left: 2px solid #333;
}

.notice {
  color: #859900;
  font-style: italic;
}

.line {
  line-height: 1.8rem;
  display: table;
}

#logs {
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  padding: 1.5rem;
}
</style></head><body><h1>IRC channel logs</h1><h2>2024-10-10.log</h2><p><a href="/bootstrappable">back to list of logs</a></p><div id="logs"><div class="line" id="060209"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#060209" label="[06:02:09]">&lt;pabs3&gt;</a></span><span class="message"> <a rel="nofollow" href="https://bootstrappable.org/">https://bootstrappable.org/</a>  seems to be down, TCP connection times out</span></div><div class="line" id="194818"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#194818" label="[19:48:18]">&lt;matrix_bridge&gt;</a></span><span class="message">&lt;Andrius Štikonas&gt; (matrix test)</span></div><div class="line" id="194828"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#194828" label="[19:48:28]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">ok, seems to be fixed now</span></div><div class="line" id="201922"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#201922" label="[20:19:22]">&lt;matrix_bridge&gt;</a></span><span class="message">&lt;cosinusoidally&gt; yep I see the test message too</span></div><div class="line" id="201933"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#201933" label="[20:19:33]">&lt;matrix_bridge&gt;</a></span><span class="message">&lt;cosinusoidally&gt; and my message just now</span></div><br /></div></body></html>